--TEST--
A declaration with no body owes the return slot too, because an interface member is exactly what a caller reads — `rule:types/declaration`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Shaped {
    public function area();
}
echo "unreachable\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0823]: `area` declares no return type
  --> case.nvs:3:21
%A
